t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Void</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Light Darkling Drop</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">18.75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.1875</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.90.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Not to be confused with the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_etcher\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shadow etcher\">Shadow Etcher</a>, the Light Etcher is a black and white axe rarely dropped from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Void\" title=\"The Void\">Light Axe Darklings</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Void\" title=\"The Void\">The Void</a>. It has the special ability of doing considerably more damage to the rarely spawning <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_trees\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavenly trees\">Heavenly Tree</a>.\n</p><p>Like the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_etcher\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shadow etcher\">Shadow Etcher</a>, the Light Etcher also has a drop rate of 2%, though the lower spawn rate of Light Axe Darklings can make obtaining the axe particularly challenging.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ability\">Ability</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Lightetchereffect.png/revision/latest?cb=20250819045031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Light Etchers ability being activated\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Lightetchereffect.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250819045031\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"169\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Lightetchereffect.png\" data-image-key=\"Lightetchereffect.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Lightetchereffect.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Light Etchers ability being activated</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>When hitting a tree there is a roughly 50% chance of the Light etchers ability to activate, this ability summons a large white etcher formed of light making a loud chopping sound and deals a considerable amount of damage to the log.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831170131\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 69/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019475/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.167      1 Template:Axe\n100.00%   28.167      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4319-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831170131 and revision id 21298. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Axes","Tools"],"links":[{"title":"Heavenly trees","exists":true},{"title":"Shadow etcher","exists":true},{"title":"The Void","exists":true}],"images":["Lightetcher1.png","Lightetchereffect.png"]}
